      "explanation": "gpupdate /force requests immediate reapplication of both user and computer Group Policy on the local device; some extensions still require sign-out or restart, and domain contact must be available where needed. gpresult reports resulting policy rather than applying it: /R gives summary information, /V verbose details, and /H writes an HTML report with a filename. /R does not mean remote; remote targeting uses /S. Refreshing System Information or reloading a local console does not cause domain GPO settings to be reapplied.",
