      "question": "Which command requests a DHCP lease renewal on all eligible DHCP-enabled network adapters?",
      "explanation": "ipconfig /renew requests an IPv4 DHCP lease renewal for eligible DHCP-configured adapters; without an adapter argument it applies to eligible adapters generally. It cannot repair an unplugged cable or force an unreachable DHCP server to answer, and static adapters are not assigned a DHCP lease by this command. /release relinquishes a lease, /all displays details, and plain ipconfig displays basic configuration. Renewal is the only listed command whose purpose is to obtain or refresh the lease rather than inspect or remove it.",
