      "explanation": "Storage Sense can run automatically to remove eligible temporary files and manage Recycle Bin retention according to configured thresholds, including 30 days. It is not limited to a manual cleanup every time space is low. Disk Cleanup can perform a manual cleanup but is not the Settings automation feature requested. Optimize Drives handles storage layout/TRIM maintenance rather than deleting old Recycle Bin contents, and System Restore manages restore points. Review configured categories because automatic cleanup intentionally removes data and should not be used as a backup strategy.",
