      "explanation": "Settings > Apps > Default apps controls file associations, allowing the user to select the preferred application for .pdf files. Installing a PDF editor does not necessarily change that association automatically. Personalization > Taskbar changes interface appearance, Accounts > Sign-in options configures authentication, and System > Storage manages capacity rather than choosing the PDF handler. Confirm the selected app is installed and supports the extension. Changing a default does not move, convert, or modify the existing PDF files.",
