      "question": "What is the recommended first step if you suspect your computer has been infected by malware (like a worm or ransomware)? (Choose one)",
      "explanation": "Disconnect the suspected infected machine from networks to contain spread and contact the incident-response team. Isolation is not eradication; remediation investigates and removes the compromise, while recovery restores a trusted state and data from verified backups. Safe Mode and antimalware scans can assist in some cases but are not a universal ransomware cure and may be inappropriate before evidence collection. Paying does not guarantee decryption or deletion of stolen data. Restore only after addressing the intrusion and verify backup integrity; do not reconnect a still-compromised device simply because files were restored.",
