      "explanation": "Extend these displays creates independent desktop space across the laptop and external screen. Move the presentation or video to the external display while retaining controls, notes, or other work on the laptop. Duplicate mirrors the same content and cannot isolate private notes; a show-only option disables the other display. Scaling and resolution affect size and pixel detail, not independent workspaces. To place the laptop on the left half, also drag its monitor icon to the left in Display settings: selecting Extend alone does not determine physical arrangement.",
