      "type": "single",
      "question": "On your Windows 11 computer, you encounter an error when trying to download and install a webcam application from the Microsoft Store. What utility can help you fix this installation problem?",
      "explanation": "wsreset.exe resets the Microsoft Store cache and is a reasonable troubleshooting tool for a Store download or installation problem. It does not install or update the webcam’s hardware driver. Device Manager is appropriate for device detection and drivers; Event Viewer provides diagnostic records, and Windows Update services Windows and selected drivers. None directly targets the Store cache. Resetting the cache is an attempt, not a guaranteed solution: persistent failures may require checking connectivity, storage, account state, requirements, or the Store application itself.",
